---
title: "Case index"
layout: layouts/page.njk
bodyClass: cases
permalink: /cases/
---
{#- The case register (design change 2026-09-26): every case in src/_data/cases.json, in date order,
    with its holding and every journal entry that mentions it. Nothing here is typed by hand. -#}
<p>Every case the journal cites, oldest first, with what it held and the entries that discuss it.</p>
{%- for c in casesByYear %}
{%- set posts = collections.journal | citing(c.slug) %}
<div class="case" id="{{ c.slug }}">
<h3>{{ c.name }}, {{ c.year }}</h3>
<p>{{ c.held | mdInline | safe }}</p>
{%- if posts.length %}
<p class="case-cited">Discussed in {% for p in posts %}<a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.data.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
{%- endif %}
</div>
{%- endfor %}
